In order to compile "xim", you must have the following components of the X
window system, version 11 release 3, installed on your system:

 - header files, accessible from the C preprocessor as "#include <X11/...>"

 - Xlib, accessible from the C loader as "-lX11"

The IPW command "ipw2xim" will convert an IPW image to the format expected by
"xim".

